<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><em>Thanks to the 7th Annual Tin Cup Challenge, we were able to purchase 50 tons of hay, 52 bags of supplemental feeds and provide farrier and veterinarian care to all our horses throughout the year! We were also able to foster 6 additional horses and send one horse to a professional trainer to advance its adoption potential, with enough left to secure a portable shelter and round pen for on-property training. As a 100% volunteer-driven organization, the Tin Cup Challenge accounted for approximately 60% of our operating budget in 2014 and provided us with the funding needed to continue our mission to provide a happy, healthy and nurturing environment for unwanted, abused, abandoned, retired and neglected horses.</em></p>
